{"symbol":"DEEPAKCHEM","yahoo":"DEEPAKCHEM.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Deepak Chemtex Limited","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Specialty Chemicals","website":"https://www.deepakchemtex.in","about":"Deepak Chemtex Limited engages in the manufacturing and sale of specialty chemicals, colourants, and related products in India. It offers acid blue 9 powder and liquid, fast green FCF, acid dyes, salt-free and pond dyes, lake colors, and dye intermediates, as well as food, drug, and cosmetic colors. The company's products are used in various applications, including confectionary, bakery, desserts, beverages, dairy products, seasonings, pet food, pharmaceutical products, cosmetics, personal care and car wash products, portable sanitation cleaners, detergent and soap, fuel, oil and lubricants, smoke, seed treatment, crop protection, fertilizer indicators, and floral dyes, as well as ink jet inks applications. It also exports its products in China, France, Kenya, Mexico, Europe, Japan, Australia, the United Kingdom, the United States of America, and other countries. Deepak Chemtex Limited was incorporated in 1997 and is based in Chennai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:18:00+00:00","quote":{"price":82.8,"prevClose":80.11,"marketCap":89.95,"high52":150.0,"low52":69.2,"pe":10.91,"bookValue":58.38,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":14.23,"shares":1.0864,"insiders":74.23,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-12-06","2023-12-07","2023-12-08","2023-12-11","2023-12-12","2023-12-13","2023-12-14","2023-12-15","2023-12-18","2023-12-19","2023-12-20","2023-12-21","2023-12-22","2023-12-26","2023-12-27","2023-12-28","2023-12-29","2024-01-01","2024-01-02","2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","20